PetalburgCity_House2_Text_RickBecameGymLeader: @ 8207905
	.string "Rick became our town's new\n"
	.string "Gym Leader.\p"
	.string "I think he called his family over from\n"
	.string "somewhere far away.$"

PetalburgCity_House2_Text_BattledRickOnce: @ 8207969
	.string "I battled Rick once, but, whew,\n"
	.string "he was way too strong.\p"
	.string "How would I put it?\p"
	.string "I just got the feeling that he\n"
	.string "lives for Pokémon.$"

`
